title: The Civil Guards
subtitle: Farmers, shopkeepers and students drill with army rifles.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1919 and month = 7 and crisis = 0
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
// the party grows month by month in 1919; between the great clashes the state of siege eases
Q.repression -= 6; Q.militancy -= 2;
if (!Q.ultraleft_gone && Q.heidelberg_outcome == 0) { Q.ultraleft_satisfaction = Math.max(Q.ultraleft_satisfaction, 30); }
var g = Math.max(1.05, Math.min(1.35, 1.24 + Q.worker_support / 200 - Q.repression / 400));
for (var d of Q.districts) { Q['district_' + d + '_members'] *= g; }
Q.freikorps_strength += 40;
Q.civil_guards_strength += 200;
Q.police_strength += 20;
!}

= The Civil Guards

Since the spring the state has armed civil guards in every town: Einwohnerwehren of farmers, shopkeepers, students and officials, with rifles from the army's depots and a machine gun in the town hall. [? if bavaria_soviet = 1 : In Bavaria, after the council republic, they are growing fastest of all. ?][? if bavaria_soviet = 2 : North of the truce line, Bavaria's civil guards are an army in all but name. ?] In some industrial towns of Saxony, Social Democratic workers have joined them to get a rifle.

- @infiltrate: Send our people into the civil guards in Saxony and Thuringia.
- @hundreds: Build our own defence squads in Halle and Merseburg.
- @soldiers: Leaflets for the barracks.

@infiltrate
subtitle: Rifles for workers, at the state's expense. If it is found out, the Saxon party pays.
on-arrival: {!
Q.civil_guards_loyalty -= 6;
Q.lean_unionist += 2;
RG.district('saxony', {guards: 0.6});
RG.district('thuringia', {guards: 0.4});
!}

In the working-class districts of Chemnitz and Gera whole guard units fill up with union men and Communists. The rifles are kept at home.

@hundreds
subtitle: [? if lock_uprising = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Armed squads, trained in secret. The police will hear of it.
choose-if: lock_uprising < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids building armed units.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_uprising == 1) { Q.unity -= 5; Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 5; }
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
RG.district('halle', {guards: 1, repression: 6, militancy: 4});
!}

Young comrades drill with broomsticks in the woods outside Merseburg, and with real rifles after dark.

@soldiers
subtitle: Cheap, and some of the leaflets will be kept.
on-arrival: army_loyalty -= 4; lean_luxemburgist += 1

"Soldiers, your officers are preparing a coup against you too." Some leaflets are handed to the officers. Some are not.
